{"id":"4a2a7a8614871e68","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-norm-on-set.md","title":"ZFC Norm On Set","display":"df-zfc-norm-on-set — ZFC Norm On Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-norm-on-set"],"display":"df-zfc-norm-on-set — ZFC Norm On Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-norm-on-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-norm-on-set — ZFC Norm On Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\rho\\in V\">\\(A,\\rho\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A},\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A},\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span> (induced relations defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (ordinal-valued norm predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\lambda)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\lambda)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\n\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\lor\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\n\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\lor\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since a set function cannot have the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> as codomain, ordinal-valued means that its range is bounded by some set ordinal.</li>\n<li>The induced relations are defined only under that typing guard, and ordinal comparison is expressed by membership (with equality for the non-strict relation), rather than by an unregistered generic order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]]) and $\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A},\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,\\lambda)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\preccurlyeq_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\n\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\lor\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}norm\\text{-}on\\text{-}set\\text{-}strict}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\rho,A)\\to\n\\prec_{\\rho,A}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\times A:\\rho(x)\\in\\rho(y)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false}],"bytes":1634,"backlinks":[{"id":"fdd9f7cf9e95c90e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-norm-on-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2835","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-norm-on-set.md|58-df-zfc-norm-on-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}